deskence (0.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Renamed the remaining identifiers to Deskence: application ID,
    settings schema, extension UUIDs and data folders. Settings, enabled
    features, favorites and icon positions of better-gnome-desktop are
    taken over at the next login.
  * Dock: window previews on hover; no extra space next to the
    applications button with magnification.
  * Settings: larger, clearer dock and desktop icon previews.

 -- Rafał Grochala <rafal.grochala@pixmedia.pl>  Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:30:00 +0100

deskence (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Renamed from better-gnome-desktop to Deskence: package and command
    deskence; better-gnome-desktop is a transitional package and the old
    command a symlink.
  * Dock: running indicators under the icons of a bottom dock.
  * Settings: page icons, "About" menu item.

